<title>USA: WebSecure shrs leap on first trading day.</title>
<headline>WebSecure shrs leap on first trading day.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>WebSecure Inc's shares made a dramatic debut on Thursday, reaching a high of 15-1/4 and then closing at 14-3/4, up 6-3/4 from their IPO price of $8.</p>
<p>The one million share offering was lead managed by Coburn &amp; Meredith and included one million warrants.</p>
<p>WebSecure is a development stage company offering Internet access and support services for secure commercial transactions and communications over the Internet.  </p>
<p>The shares were expected to price in a range of $6 to $8 per share.</p>
</text>
